# Unified-diff blank context lines contain a required leading space.
# Context lines of tab-indented sources (TypeScript in pi) start with that space followed
# by tabs, which `git diff --check` would otherwise report as space-before-tab.
# A final blank context line is part of its hunk, not an extra blank file line.
*.patch whitespace=-blank-at-eol,-blank-at-eof,-space-before-tab
